Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 22:29:42 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Add the two trust & safety copy moments the redesign brief
 calls for

The brief's Terms of Service already has strong liability language
(Section 9: "We are not responsible for the actions, conduct, or safety
of users..."), but it was never surfaced anywhere outside the ToS page
itself. Added plain-language versions at the two moments the brief names:

- During sign-in/sign-up, before account creation completes: a short
  notice on auth-signin.tsx that HiBowan doesn't verify identity and
  isn't responsible for other users' conduct.
- At the moment two strangers are about to connect: a line under "Send
  Request" on Trip Detail (shown only while no request is pending yet),
  and a matching line above "Accept Request" on the organizer's request-
  management page, right before a chat thread opens between them.

Also fixed a JSX structural issue introduced while adding the accept-side
reminder (the button row needed an extra wrapping div once the reminder
text was added above it).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
